{"op": "append", "content": "[\u2139\ufe0f] [2026-01-08 11:10:03 UTC] [Agent: ResearchAgent-ManageDocs] [Project: doc_registration_fix] Starting investigation into manage_docs create_* actions - looking for registration gaps where files are written but not registered in docs_json | approach=Inspect doc_management/manager.py for implementation of create_* actions and check for missing registration calls; reasoning={\"how\": \"Use read_file with mode='search' to find create_research_doc, create_bug_report, create_review_report, create_agent_report_card implementations. Check for _register_doc calls or similar\", \"what\": \"Need to trace code path from action dispatch -> file write -> registration check. Constraints: must understand how docs are registered, where INDEX.md fits, whether registration is even called\", \"why\": \"When create_* actions write files, subsequent manage_docs operations fail because docs are not registered in docs_json\"}; task=Find doc registration gap in create_research_doc, create_bug_report, create_review_report, create_agent_report_card; priority=low; confidence=0.7; log_type=progress; content_type=log\n", "file_path": "/home/austin/projects/MCP_SPINE/scribe_mcp/.scribe/docs/dev_plans/doc_registration_fix/PROGRESS_LOG.md", "id": "2026-01-08T11:10:03.252233+00:00_a7ce2a00", "timestamp": "2026-01-08T11:10:03.252260+00:00"}
