{"op": "append", "content": "[\u2139\ufe0f] [2026-01-08 11:10:04 UTC] [Agent: ResearchAgent-DocsJson] [Project: doc_registration_fix] Starting investigation: How does docs_json registration work? Need to understand the structure and where auto-created docs should be registered.\", <parameter name=\"status\">info | investigation_scope=[\"storage/sqlite.py\", \"storage/base.py\", \"tools/set_project.py\", \"tools/generate_doc_templates.py\"]; reasoning={\"how\": \"Will search storage/sqlite.py and storage/base.py for docs_json handling, then trace set_project and generate_doc_templates to see registration flow\", \"what\": \"Need to find: (1) how docs_json gets stored/updated in storage layer, (2) structure of docs_json, (3) update methods, (4) how standard docs get registered\", \"why\": \"Auto-created docs (research reports, bug reports, reviews, INDEX files) aren't registered in docs_json, causing manage_docs to fail finding them later\"}; task=Understand doc registration mechanism; priority=medium; log_type=progress; content_type=log\n", "file_path": "/home/austin/projects/MCP_SPINE/scribe_mcp/.scribe/docs/dev_plans/doc_registration_fix/PROGRESS_LOG.md", "id": "2026-01-08T11:10:04.297776+00:00_828e5ae2", "timestamp": "2026-01-08T11:10:04.297803+00:00"}
