{"op": "append", "content": "[\u2139\ufe0f] [2026-01-08 11:11:03 UTC] [Agent: ResearchAgent-ManageDocs] [Project: doc_registration_fix] Found create_* action implementations in tools/manage_docs.py (lines 2371-2601). Key pattern: Files are written, INDEX.md is updated, but docs_json registration is MISSING. Index updaters (lines 2400, 2430, 2437, 2448) exist but no registration call to backend. | file=tools/manage_docs.py; finding=create_research_doc, create_bug_report, create_review_report, create_agent_report_card all skip docs_json registration; gap=No call to _register_doc or update project docs_json after file creation; index_update=INDEX.md is updated via async index_updater() but this doesn't register in docs_json; lines=2371-2601; priority=low; confidence=0.9; log_type=progress; content_type=log\n", "file_path": "/home/austin/projects/MCP_SPINE/scribe_mcp/.scribe/docs/dev_plans/doc_registration_fix/PROGRESS_LOG.md", "id": "2026-01-08T11:11:03.326051+00:00_f767b22b", "timestamp": "2026-01-08T11:11:03.326088+00:00"}
