{"op": "append", "content": "[\u2705] [2026-01-08 11:12:15 UTC] [Agent: ResearchAgent-ManageDocs] [Project: doc_registration_fix] Root cause identified: create_* actions (create_research_doc, create_bug_report, create_review_report, create_agent_report_card) in _handle_special_document_creation (lines 2337-2601) write files but skip docs_json registration. After file write, code calls: _record_special_doc_change() [changelog only], append_entry() [progress log], index_updater() [INDEX.md update], but NO update_project_docs() call. Compare to EDIT_ACTIONS which call _auto_register_document() at line 1306. | affected_actions=[\"create_research_doc\", \"create_bug_report\", \"create_review_report\", \"create_agent_report_card\"]; file_path=tools/manage_docs.py; gap_impact=Subsequent manage_docs operations fail with 'DOC_NOT_FOUND' because created docs are not in project.docs; missing_call=await backend.update_project_docs(project_name, docs_json); problematic_section=2523-2601; root_cause=Missing update_project_docs() call in _handle_special_document_creation; working_pattern=EDIT_ACTIONS use _auto_register_document at line 1306; priority=medium; confidence=0.95; log_type=progress; content_type=log\n", "file_path": "/home/austin/projects/MCP_SPINE/scribe_mcp/.scribe/docs/dev_plans/doc_registration_fix/PROGRESS_LOG.md", "id": "2026-01-08T11:12:15.591668+00:00_191ab93c", "timestamp": "2026-01-08T11:12:15.591698+00:00"}
