{"op": "append", "content": "[\u2139\ufe0f] [2026-01-08 11:12:56 UTC] [Agent: ResearchAgent-DocsJson] [Project: doc_registration_fix] Research complete: Created RESEARCH_DOCS_JSON_REGISTRATION_20260108.md documenting the complete docs_json registration flow and the gap in auto-created document registration. Key findings: (1) docs_json structure is a JSON object mapping doc types to paths, (2) Standard docs registered during set_project, (3) update_project_docs() method exists but is never called by manage_docs.py create_* actions, (4) Solution is to call update_project_docs() after creating each auto-doc.\", <parameter name=\"status\">success | confidence=0.95; findings_count=5; next_steps=Architect can now design the fix for manage_docs.py create_* actions to call update_project_docs(); reasoning={\"how\": \"Comprehensive analysis: verified docs_json structure, traced initialization flow, confirmed storage backend method exists, documented proposed solution with code patterns\", \"what\": \"Traced code flow from set_project through storage backend, found update_project_docs() method is never called by manage_docs.py create_* actions\", \"why\": \"Research complete - documented the entire registration mechanism and identified the specific gap\"}; research_file=/home/austin/projects/MCP_SPINE/scribe_mcp/.scribe/docs/dev_plans/doc_registration_fix/research/RESEARCH_DOCS_JSON_REGISTRATION_20260108.md; priority=medium; log_type=progress; content_type=log\n", "file_path": "/home/austin/projects/MCP_SPINE/scribe_mcp/.scribe/docs/dev_plans/doc_registration_fix/PROGRESS_LOG.md", "id": "2026-01-08T11:12:56.259983+00:00_0befe374", "timestamp": "2026-01-08T11:12:56.260013+00:00"}
