{"op": "append", "content": "[\u2139\ufe0f] [2026-01-08 11:13:09 UTC] [Agent: ResearchAgent-DocsJson] [Project: doc_registration_fix] Research investigation COMPLETE for project doc_registration_fix. Delivered RESEARCH_DOCS_JSON_REGISTRATION_20260108.md with comprehensive findings on docs_json registration mechanism. All investigation questions answered: (1) docs_json structure verified, (2) registration flow documented with code references, (3) gap identified in manage_docs.py, (4) proposed solution provided with code patterns. Ready for Architect stage.\", <parameter name=\"status\">success | confidence=0.95; deliverables=[\"RESEARCH_DOCS_JSON_REGISTRATION_20260108.md\"]; findings=[\"docs_json is JSON dict storing {architecture, phase_plan, checklist, progress_log}\", \"Storage backend method update_project_docs() exists in storage/sqlite.py:177\", \"set_project.py uses update_project_docs() at line 295\", \"manage_docs.py NEVER calls update_project_docs() for auto-created docs (0 matches in file)\", \"Proposed solution: add update_project_docs() call after each create_* action\", \"Solution includes code pattern for merging new docs into existing docs_json\"]; reasoning={\"how\": \"Used scribe.read_file for all investigations, traced code flow across multiple files, verified findings with multiple sources, documented with high confidence scores\", \"what\": \"Delivered comprehensive research document with 5 major findings, complete code reference trail, and proposed solution approach\", \"why\": \"Entire investigation complete with all findings documented and handed off\"}; status=ready_for_architect; total_log_entries=4; priority=medium; log_type=progress; content_type=log\n", "file_path": "/home/austin/projects/MCP_SPINE/scribe_mcp/.scribe/docs/dev_plans/doc_registration_fix/PROGRESS_LOG.md", "id": "2026-01-08T11:13:09.777193+00:00_2534325f", "timestamp": "2026-01-08T11:13:09.777259+00:00"}
