{"op": "append", "content": "[\u2139\ufe0f] [2026-01-08 11:13:30 UTC] [Agent: ResearchAgent-DocsJson] [Project: doc_registration_fix] RESEARCH STAGE 1 COMPLETE. Produced 274-line research document (RESEARCH_DOCS_JSON_REGISTRATION_20260108.md) analyzing docs_json registration mechanism. Findings: (1) docs_json is JSON dict {architecture, phase_plan, checklist, progress_log} stored in scribe_projects.docs_json, (2) initialized in set_project.py:251-256 and persisted via upsert_project(), (3) update_project_docs() method exists (storage/sqlite.py:177-185) and is used by set_project but never called by manage_docs.py, (4) all 4 create_* actions (create_research_doc, create_bug_report, create_review_report, create_agent_report_card) skip docs_json registration after file creation, (5) proposed solution includes code pattern for merging new docs into existing docs_json. Ready for Architect Agent (Stage 2) to design the fix.\", <parameter name=\"status\">success | code_references_provided=12; confidence=0.95; document_path=/home/austin/projects/MCP_SPINE/scribe_mcp/.scribe/docs/dev_plans/doc_registration_fix/research/RESEARCH_DOCS_JSON_REGISTRATION_20260108.md; document_size_lines=274; findings_verified=5; handoff_ready=True; next_stage=architecture; proposed_solution_included=True; reasoning={\"how\": \"Traced code flow across set_project.py, storage/sqlite.py, storage/base.py, and manage_docs.py; verified each claim with file:line references\", \"what\": \"Delivered research document with verified findings, code references, and proposed solution approach with code patterns\", \"why\": \"Complete handoff from Research to Architecture stage with all findings documented\"}; research_questions_answered=4; stage=research; stage_status=complete; total_log_entries=5; priority=medium; log_type=progress; content_type=log\n", "file_path": "/home/austin/projects/MCP_SPINE/scribe_mcp/.scribe/docs/dev_plans/doc_registration_fix/PROGRESS_LOG.md", "id": "2026-01-08T11:13:30.589837+00:0