{"op": "append", "content": "[\u2705] [2026-01-08 11:13:47 UTC] [Agent: ResearchAgent-ManageDocs] [Project: doc_registration_fix] RESEARCH INVESTIGATION SUMMARY: Identified why manage_docs create_* actions fail to register documents. Root cause: Missing update_project_docs() call after file creation. Solution: Add 15-20 lines of registration code between lines 2584-2595 in _handle_special_document_creation(). Pattern exists in _auto_register_document() (lines 954-981) for reference. Fix will enable create\u2192edit workflow and restore parity between CREATE_ACTIONS and EDIT_ACTIONS behavior. | affected_actions=create_research_doc, create_bug_report, create_review_report, create_agent_report_card; code_insertion_point=tools/manage_docs.py lines 2584-2595; deliverable=RESEARCH_MANAGE_DOCS_CREATE_ACTIONS_20260108.md; expected_effort=15-20 lines of code; handoff_ready=True; investigation_phase=complete; output_location=/home/austin/projects/MCP_SPINE/scribe_mcp/.scribe/docs/dev_plans/doc_registration_fix/research/; reference_implementation=_auto_register_document() function lines 954-981; research_confidence=0.95; root_cause=Missing update_project_docs() and ProjectRegistry.record_doc_update() calls in _handle_special_document_creation after file write; priority=medium; confidence=0.95; log_type=progress; content_type=log\n", "file_path": "/home/austin/projects/MCP_SPINE/scribe_mcp/.scribe/docs/dev_plans/doc_registration_fix/PROGRESS_LOG.md", "id": "2026-01-08T11:13:47.824257+00:00_0cf116a3", "timestamp": "2026-01-08T11:13:47.824287+00:00"}
